  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before. PowerToys#6756 is the main tracking issue for app-specific key remapping in Keyboard Manager. The other requests were closed as duplicates of it, including PowerToys#32265 and PowerToys#45021. Today 'Remap a key' only works globally, and only 'Remap a shortcut' has a Target App option. The feature isn't available yet. Add a thumbs-up to #6756 and describe your use case there, such as Enter sending a message instead of adding a new line. For now, you can remap shortcuts per app. For example, in the target app you could map Shift+Enter or Ctrl+Enter to the behavior you want, but a plain Enter key can't be remapped for one app only."
 },
